 (Ctrl/Cmd+3): finds commands, views, perspectives and preferences by their names.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
(3) The perspective bar
\series default
: opens and switches the perspectives (e.g., R, Document, ImageJ Edit, Resource, R ImageJ Analysis, 3d, WorldWind, Web, Custom).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
(4) and (8) Views
\series default
, e.g., the Project Explorer and the Outline.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
