 with the opened editors (e.g., the R editor).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
(6) Views below the editor
\series default
, e.g., the Console, the Properties and the Snippets.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
(7) The status line
\series default
: the memory (a click on the trash icon starts the garbage collection of Java), the selection, the time steps of a simulation (see Counter Reset) and the state of the editor (e.g., Writable, Insert, the line).
\end_layout

