\begin_layout Standard
The toolbar contains the default actions of Bio7 which are described below. Editors and plugins add their own actions to the toolbar (e.g., the actions of the active editor). The toolbar can be hidden with 
\series bold
Window > Show/Hide Toolbar
\series default
.
\end_layout

